{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18878","headline":"八月十五日夜桃源翫月 · 刘禹锡","name":"八月十五日夜桃源翫月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尘中见月心亦闲，况是清秋仙府间。\n凝光悠悠寒露坠，此时立在最高山。\n碧虚无云风不起，山上长松山下水。\n羣动翛然一顾中，天高地平千万里。\n少君引我昇玉坛，礼空遥请真仙官。\n云軿欲下星斗动，天乐一声肌骨寒。\n金霞昕昕渐东上，轮欹影促犹频望。\n绝景良时难再幷，他年此日应惆怅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18878.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18878","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}